person.note:
Assistant Secretary of State for Congressional Relations until October 1969;
                    thereafter Deputy Under Secretary of State for Administration (title changed to
                    Management after July 12, 1971) from October 1969 to April 1973

Assistant Director, Bureau of the Budget, from January 1969 until June 1970;
                    Assistant Director, Office of Management and Budget, from July 1970 until August
                    1971; thereafter Chairman, Atomic Energy Commission
